13036	SEC-SQL-PRI-001-RC15	mariadb	Resolve PRI-001-RC15 (mysql)	resolve-pii-rc15-cached-plans-mariadb	Cached or active-transaction queries reference PII columns. Actions: (1) review the rows — each links a session/transaction/query_text to a sensitive table and column; (2) for cached_plan rows, identify the application or job that produced the query and verify legitimate business need; (3) for active_transaction rows, investigate why a session is holding state on PII data — if unintentional, terminate; (4) enforce column-level access controls and dynamic data masking; (5) ensure DAM logging captures access to sensitive tables.	supervised	critical	\N	authored	\N	t	\N	\N	2026-05-11 22:17:39.229791	2026-05-11 22:17:39.229791
